        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>11月龄宝宝的辅食攻略</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']]}\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    padding:0;\n    background:#e8e8e6;\n    font-family:\"Microsoft YaHei\",\"PingFang SC\",sans-serif;\n    font-size:11px;\n    color:#222;\n  }\n  .page{\n    width:1000px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    background:#fff;\n    display:flex;\n    position:relative;\n    box-shadow:0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,.2);\n  }\n  .left-col{\n    width:52%;\n    padding:14px 18px 26px 22px;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n    border-right:1px solid #ccc;\n  }\n  .right-col{\n    width:48%;\n    padding:14px 18px 26px 20px;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n  }\n  .title-band{\n    background:#8cc63e;\n    color:#fff;\n    padding:8px 14px;\n    border-radius:2px 14px 14px 2px;\n    font-size:17px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    letter-spacing:1px;\n    margin-bottom:14px;\n  }\n  h3.sec{\n    color:#5a8f10;\n    font-size:13px;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    margin:14px 0 6px 0;\n    padding-left:2px;\n  }\n  ul{\n    margin:0 0 0 14px;\n    padding:0;\n    list-style-type:disc;\n  }\n  ul li{\n    margin-bottom:4px;\n    line-height:1.5;\n  }\n  .recipe{\n    margin-bottom:12px;\n  }\n  .recipe-head{\n    background:#8cc63e;\n    color:#fff;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    font-size:12px;\n    padding:4px 10px;\n    border-radius:2px 10px 10px 2px;\n    margin-bottom:5px;\n  }\n  .recipe p{\n    margin:3px 0;\n    line-height:1.5;\n  }\n  .recipe .lbl{\n    color:#5a8f10;\n    font-weight:bold;\n  }\n  .food-grid{\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);\n    gap:6px 8px;\n    margin:8px 0 6px 0;\n    width:92%;\n  }\n  .food-cell{\n    text-align:center;\n  }\n  .placeholder{\n    background:#f2f2ee;\n    border:1px solid #d8d8d2;\n    border-radius:50%;\n    width:88px;\n    height:60px;\n    margin:0 auto;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    font-size:8px;\n    color:#888;\n    text-align:center;\n    box-sizing:border-box;\n  }\n  .food-cell .cap{\n    font-size:10px;\n    margin-top:2px;\n  }\n  table.diet{\n    border-collapse:collapse;\n    width:96%;\n    margin-top:4px;\n    font-size:11px;\n  }\n  table.diet td{\n    padding:3px 4px;\n    vertical-align:top;\n    line-height:1.4;\n  }\n  table.diet td.k{\n    color:#5a8f10;\n    font-weight:bold;\n    white-space:nowrap;\n    width:70px;\n  }\n  .note{\n    margin-top:14px;\n    background:#8cc63e;\n    color:#fff;\n    font-size:10px;\n    padding:4px 10px;\n    border-radius:2px 10px 10px 2px;\n  }\n  .spine{\n    position:absolute;\n    left:52%;\n    top:0;\n    bottom:0;\n    width:6px;\n    background:linear-gradient(to right,#d9d9d4,#f6f6f3);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"left-col\">\n    <div class=\"title-band\">11月龄宝宝的辅食攻略</div>\n\n    <h3 class=\"sec\">喂养重点</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>母乳注意量、辅食、菜、肉合理搭配，保证全面入量</li>\n      <li>注意为宝宝营造良好的进餐环境，让宝宝专注进餐</li>\n      <li>如果给宝宝购买辅食食物，要多化点/合理营养料签</li>\n      <li>如果宝宝愿意自己拿勺子，可尝试让宝宝抓着勺子练习[?]</li>\n      <li>继续逐渐锻炼长出牙齿[?]，逐渐锻炼咀嚼[illegible]</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <h3 class=\"sec\">辅食性状</h3>\n    <ul>\n      <li>较大的块状食物（以米饭、面条、猪肉、蔬菜、南瓜为例）</li>\n    </ul>\n\n    <div class=\"food-grid\">\n      <div class=\"food-cell\"><div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 米饭]</div><div class=\"cap\">米饭</div></div>\n      <div class=\"food-cell\"><div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 面条]</div><div class=\"cap\">面条</div></div>\n      <div class=\"food-cell\"><div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 猪肉]</div><div class=\"cap\">猪肉</div></div>\n      <div class=\"food-cell\"><div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 蔬菜]</div><div class=\"cap\">蔬菜</div></div>\n      <div class=\"food-cell\"><div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo: 南瓜]</div><div class=\"cap\">南瓜</div></div>\n      <div class=\"food-cell\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <h3 class=\"sec\">喂养建议</h3>\n    <table class=\"diet\">\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"k\">乳品喂养量</td>\n        <td>每日 2-4 次，总计 600-700ml</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"k\">辅食喂养量</td>\n        <td>每日 2-3 次，每次 3/4 碗</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"k\">辅食选择</td>\n        <td></td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"k\">谷薯类</td>\n        <td>软饭、碎米饭、小饆头、面包 1/2-3/4 碗</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"k\">水果类</td>\n        <td>碎菜 1/2 碗</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"k\">水果类</td>\n        <td>水果 1/2 碗</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"k\">肉、蛋、禽、鱼、豆类</td>\n        <td>蛋黄、肉、鱼 4-6 勺</td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td class=\"k\">植物油</td>\n        <td>每日 5-10g，不加盐</td>\n      </tr>\n    </table>\n\n    <div class=\"note\">备注：以上摄食选择为参考量，可根据宝宝的实际情况适量调整。</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"spine\"></div>\n\n  <div class=\"right-col\">\n    <h3 class=\"sec\">经典食谱</h3>\n\n    <div class=\"recipe\">\n      <div class=\"recipe-head\">食谱一：青菜肉松疙瘟汤</div>\n      <p><span class=\"lbl\">用料：</span>青菜、肉松、面粉、盐、食用油、水</p>\n      <p><span class=\"lbl\">做法：</span></p>\n      <p>1. 青菜洗净切小段备用。</p>\n      <p>2. 面粉加水少许，搅拌成小面疙瘟备用。</p>\n      <p>3. 锅内加水煮沸，下入面疙瘟煮至[?]浮起。</p>\n      <p>4. 加入青菜段煮软，撒入肉松，滴入少许食用油即可。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"recipe\">\n      <div class=\"recipe-head\">食谱二：香菇腐肉</div>\n      <p><span class=\"lbl\">用料：</span>香菇、猪肉、盐、食用油、水</p>\n      <p><span class=\"lbl\">做法：</span></p>\n      <p>1. 鲜香菇洗净后用清水浸泡，去除根部，切成小碎末。</p>\n      <p>2. 猪肉洗净剁成细末，加入少许水搅拌上劲。</p>\n      <p>3. 锅内加油烧热，下入香菇末炒香，加入肉末同炒至变色。</p>\n      <p>4. 加适量清水，小火焖煮 10 分钟，收汁调味即可出锅。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"recipe\">\n      <div class=\"recipe-head\">食谱三：排骨烧萝卜</div>\n      <p><span class=\"lbl\">用料：</span>排骨、萝卜、葱、姜、食用油、水</p>\n      <p><span class=\"lbl\">做法：</span></p>\n      <p>1. 排骨洗净斩小块，冷水下锅焯水去血沫，捞出洗净。</p>\n      <p>2. 萝卜洗净去皮切小块，葱姜切片备用。</p>\n      <p>3. 锅内放油烧热，下入葱姜爆香，加入排骨煸炒至微黄。</p>\n      <p>4. 加适量清水，大火烧开后转小火炖煮约 30 分钟。</p>\n      <p>5. 放入萝卜块继续炖煮至软烂，调味后出锅。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"recipe\">\n      <div class=\"recipe-head\">食谱四：紫薯米糕</div>\n      <p><span class=\"lbl\">用料：</span>紫薯、婴儿营养米粉、水</p>\n      <p><span class=\"lbl\">做法：</span></p>\n      <p>1. 紫薯洗净去皮切片，上锅蒸熟至软烂。</p>\n      <p>2. 蒸熟的紫薯放入碗中，用勺子压成细腻的紫薯泥。</p>\n      <p>3. 婴儿营养米粉用温水冲调成糊状，加入紫薯泥中。</p>\n      <p>4. 将紫薯泥和米粉糊充分搅拌均匀，倒入模具中压平。</p>\n      <p>5. 上锅蒸约 10 分钟，取出冷却后脱模切块即可食用。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
